Recursion is a process in which a method calls itself until a base condition is satisfied.
java support method recursion- fibbo,factorial

class RecursionDemo {

    static void printNum(int n) {
        if (n == 6) {        // base condition
            return;
        }
        System.out.println(n);
        printNum(n + 1);     // recursive call
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        printNum(1);
    }
}

